# Disk space monitor for robertpelloni.com / hypernexus server
# Replaced 2026-09-14: previous version had a broken awk field spec
# (awk "{print \}" instead of $5) so it never fired, and it only used
# "wall", which reaches nobody when no one is logged in.
#
# Thresholds and notification settings live in /etc/disk-alert.conf
# Script: /usr/local/bin/disk-check.py | Log: /var/log/disk-alert.log
MAILTO=""
*/15 * * * * root /usr/bin/python3 /usr/local/bin/disk-check.py >/dev/null 2>&1
